&lt;p&gt;The Forum will first be held on March 26, from 5:15&amp;nbsp;to 7:15&amp;nbsp;pm in Jerome Greene Hall, Room 106 (Law School). The March 26 forum will be in-person only and open to current CUID holders. &lt;a href="https://events.columbia.edu/go/UniversityGovernance_Forum1" target="_blank"&gt;Registration&lt;/a&gt; is required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Forum will be repeated on March 31, from 5:00 to 7:00 pm&amp;nbsp;in the Alumni Auditorium, Black Building, at the Columbia University Irving Medical Center from 5:00 to 7:00 pm on March 31. The March 31 forum will be open to current CUID holders and&amp;nbsp;alumni and will include a webinar option. Registration is required (please see below).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questions may be submitted in advance to &lt;a href="mailto:senate@columbia.edu"&gt;senate@columbia.edu&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or asked from the floor.&lt;/p&gt;
